                                                "sense_id": "afec0ac6-8222-37bf-990f-dea35a0e991c",
                                                "text": "February 2008, BBC Sport - Ramos takes centre stage\nHow different it was at Wembley as Ramos confirmed his reputation as a relentless pursuer of silverware by giving Spurs their first trophy in nine years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1725905-082d-4d6a-86eb-8375463242f3",
                                                "sense_id": "afec0ac6-8222-37bf-990f-dea35a0e991c",
